B.ZS=new A.dx("analyse_argument","Analyse a complex argument","Advanced Reading","I can distinguish a writer\u2019s claim, evidence and qualification.",B.dd,B.a4A,"\u4e00\u898b\u3059\u308b\u3068\u6709\u52b9\u3060\u304c\u3001\u9577\u671f\u7684\u306a\u5f71\u97ff\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306f\u614e\u91cd\u306a\u691c\u8a0e\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3060\u3002","Ikken suru to yuukou da ga, choukiteki na eikyou ni tsuite wa shinchou na kentou ga hitsuyou da.","It appears effective at first glance, but its long-term effects require careful consideration.",B.Vo,0,"Advanced reading depends on tracking stance markers such as \u4e00\u898b\u3059\u308b\u3068 and \u3060\u304c.","Scholar\u2019s alcove","\ud83d\udcda","negotiate_solution")
B.VY=s(["Today I will explain the situation, issues and next steps in order.","Today I will ask about the order of future issues.","The current explanation will finish tomorrow."],t.s)
B.ZY=new A.dx("professional_briefing","Deliver a professional briefing","Professional Japanese","I can present a structured briefing and respond to follow-up questions.",B.dd,B.dJ,"\u672c\u65e5\u306f\u73fe\u72b6\u3001\u8ab2\u984c\u3001\u4eca\u5f8c\u306e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u306e\u9806\u306b\u3054\u8aac\u660e\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","Honjitsu wa genjou, kadai, kongo no taiou no jun ni gosetsumei itashimasu.","Today I will explain the current situation, the issues and our next steps, in that order.",B.VY,0,"Signposting the structure at the start helps an audience follow a dense briefing.","Presentation studio","\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f","analyse_argument")
B.T9=s(["Let us begin with shared points while considering both sides\u2019 concerns.","Both sides have organised their concerns.","There are no common points to discuss."],t.s)
B.ZU=new A.dx("mediate_disagreement","Mediate a disagreement","Diplomatic Communication","I can restate competing positions neutrally and guide discussion towards common ground.",B.dd,B.Dp,"\u53cc\u65b9\u306e\u61f8\u5ff5\u3092\u8e0f\u307e\u3048\u3001\u5171\u901a\u70b9\u304b\u3089\u6574\u7406\u3057\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002","Souhou no kenen o fumae, kyoutsuuten kara seiri shite mimashou.","Taking both sides\u2019 concerns into account, let us organise the discussion from the points we share.",B.T9,0,"Neutral restatement is a core conversation-management skill and does not require hiding genuine disagreement.","Peace garden","\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f","professional_briefing")
